IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. ELIGIBLE.
DATA DIVISION.
LINKAGE SECTION.
COPY LAYOUT.
PROCEDURE DIVISION USING CUSTOMER-RECORD REFERRAL-RECORD.
  IF AGE >= 18
    MOVE "Y" TO DECISION
  ELSE
    MOVE "N" TO DECISION
  END-IF.
  IF ACTIVE = "N"
    MOVE "N" TO DECISION
  ELSE
    CONTINUE
  END-IF.
  IF CUSTOMER-ID <> REF-CUSTOMER-ID
    MOVE "N" TO DECISION
  ELSE
    CONTINUE
  END-IF.
  IF AMOUNT > 50000
    MOVE "R" TO DECISION
  ELSE
    CONTINUE
  END-IF.
  GOBACK.
